# The FIDO2 applet over ISO 7816 (TL1 step 6): debug it with CardLang: Debug Scenario.
install
power_on
select   # SELECT returns FIDO_2_0
expect sw 9000
command 80 10 00 00 04   # authenticatorGetInfo
expect sw 9000
command 80 10 00 00 07   # authenticatorReset
expect sw 9000
command 80 10 00 00 01 a0   # makeCredential with an empty map: a CTAP error, in the response under 9000
expect sw 9000
command 00 a4 04 00   # an instruction the applet does not know
expect sw 6d00
